        <mxCell id="notes_txt" value="• AXI-Stream throughout &#40;valid/ready back-pressure&#41;&#10;• frame_builder in_ready = 0 during PREAMBLE state&#10;• axis_upsample_zeros: phase 0 → hold, 1..SPS−1 → 0&#10;• axis_downsample_pick: capture only when phase == OFFSET&#10;• preamble_correlator: shift[0]=newest; coefs = PREAMBLE[L−1−k]&#10;• frame_sync_detector: threshold on mag_sq[127:64] &#40;upper 64b only&#41;&#10;• qpsk_demodulator always accepts; sync handled by downstream logic" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11" vertex="1" parent="1">
